### BUG-03: Incorrect mathematical sum in "All Roles" filter total
*   **Affected Screen:** In-App Chat (`/in-app-chat/company/all`)
*   **Browser & Screen Size:** Chrome Desktop (1920x1080)
*   **Selected Date Range:** No date range (Default view)
*   **Reproduction Steps:**
    1. Navigate to the In-App Chat screen.
    2. Click the Filter icon.
    3. Locate the "Driver Role" column.
    4. Manually sum the individual role options: Walker1 (4) + Helper1 (10) + Walker (3) + Helper (3) = 20.
    5. Compare the sum of the individual roles to the denominator in the "All Roles" total.
*   **Expected Behavior:** The "All Roles" denominator should equal the exact mathematical sum of all individual role counts presented in the list (20).
*   **Actual Behavior:** The total count shows "(4/13)". The number 13 mathematically contradicts the 20 available roles listed directly below it. 
*   **Severity and Business Impact:** **Medium.** Similar to BUG-02, this calculation error compromises the integrity of the data presented to the end user.
*   **Supporting Evidence:** **https://github.com/rushiphutane11/LMDmax-QA-Assessment./blob/8e0b9d3d01f5fb1302585bb90092d5b02b4920ff/Task%20B%20Bug%203** `image_7bf3c1.png`

