## Improvement Suggestions (Not classified as defects)
*   **Compare Empty States:** Currently, if no driver is selected on the Compare screen, the data grid renders as blank white blocks. Implementing a clear "Select a driver to view data" placeholder would greatly improve user experience.
*   **Typographical Data Errors:** Station 3 lists its Address value as "Addtess 4". While this appears to be bad test data injected into the staging database rather than a system defect, data sanitization should be reviewed prior to production.
